    243				     ; Draw the	bitmap as 2x2 cells and	count its food cells afresh.
    244				     ; Uses the	standard mode-13h palette, matching the	original game.
    245				     ; Clobbers	AX/BX/DX/SI. draw_cell preserves the source pointer and	position.
